# Nothing that grants access to a real system is ever committed.
# Week 1 Task 3 asks you to review and extend this file -- it ships here so
# that an accidental `git add .` before you get there cannot put a key or a
# state file into your history, which the grading pipeline fails on and which
# deleting in a later commit does not undo.
*.pem
*.key
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.*.backup
.terraform/
.env
credentials
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored. Commit it -- it pins the
# exact provider versions so your workstation and CI resolve the same ones.
# Terraform's own `init` output tells you to.

# Ansible / Packer working files
*.retry
packer_cache/
